  "instance_name": "mapping_001",
  "label": "The prisoners are mapped as 'the squad' about to get lit.",
  "description": "The text 'when the squad is about to get lit..' is overlaid on an image of prisoners in striped uniforms. This creates an analogical mapping where the group of prisoners (visual entity) is being equated with 'the squad' (textual entity), and their situation is being humorously likened to a group of friends preparing to party and get intoxicated. This mapping is deeply offensive as it trivializes the horrific historical context of the Holocaust by equating it with a casual social activity.",
